4. Assumption: All entries in the `superhero` table should be counted unless a status column exists. [CONFIRMED] Phase 2 and Query 9 confirm no status columns exist; contrapositive test confirms no additional filters are requested.
5. Assumption: The client wants a percentage value (count_marvel_female / count_all_female * 100). [CONFIRMED] This is the standard interpretation of "How many percent" and is supported by the numerator/denominator logic in Queries 10 and 11.

